  "prefLabel": "Env-Wt 602.40 Primary structure",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wt 602.40 “Primary structure” means a structure that is central to the fundamental use of the property and is not accessory to the use of another structure on the same property.\n\nSource. #12806, eff 12-15-19",
